#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:45
msgid ""
"The real small CMake projects exercise protected inputs, output publication,"
" identical reconfigure/no-op builds, derived artifact repair, configuration "
"and resource dependencies, external LTO and C/C++ policy propagation, "
"invalid helper arguments, mixed assembly rejection, private includes and "
"process cancellation. Source SDK fixtures deliberately mutate packages and "
"remain nonpublishable. The candidate path separately generates a clean "
"committed SDK and verifies its whole manifest before consumption."
msgstr ""
"The real small CMake projects exercise protected inputs, output publication,"
" identical reconfigure/no-op builds, derived artifact repair, configuration "
"and resource dependencies, external LTO and C/C++ policy propagation, "
"invalid helper arguments, mixed assembly rejection, private includes and "
"process cancellation. Source SDK fixtures deliberately mutate packages and "
"remain nonpublishable. The candidate path separately generates a clean "
"committed SDK and verifies its whole manifest before consumption."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:53
msgid ""
"The selected SDK result is attempt 2 in `sdk-boundaries-attempt-2`, with its"
" matching explicit receipt. It executes all 62 cases in 673.078 seconds and "
"retains 280 actual child commands and 13 consumer artifact directories. "
"Attempt 1 remains failed in the original `sdk-boundaries` namespace: missing"
" CMake on its PATH caused six errors and six skips, with zero test failures."
" No report or failed namespace was renamed or replaced to select attempt 2. "
"The SDK suite runs serially with a one-job environment default; original "
"consumer build argv explicitly request four or two jobs where specified. The"
" offline candidate compiler uses its separately recorded bound; the SDK "
"execution is not described as all compiler commands running with one job."
msgstr ""
"The selected SDK result is attempt 2 in `sdk-boundaries-attempt-2`, with its"
" matching explicit receipt. It executes all 62 cases in 673.078 seconds and "
"retains 280 actual child commands and 13 consumer artifact directories. "
"Attempt 1 remains failed in the original `sdk-boundaries` namespace: missing"
" CMake on its PATH caused six errors and six skips, with zero test failures."
" No report or failed namespace was renamed or replaced to select attempt 2. "
"The SDK suite runs serially with a one-job environment default; original "
"consumer build argv explicitly request four or two jobs where specified. The"
" offline candidate compiler uses its separately recorded bound; the SDK "
"execution is not described as all compiler commands running with one job."

