#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:124
msgid ""
"The same source, clean Source SDK, authored configuration, recursive "
"dependency pins, compiler/toolchain and OCI identities bind the executed "
"commands and actual ELF/BIN/map/resource bytes. Each candidate passes the "
"owned verifier and an actual fixed-checker `dev candidate` plan. Each "
"complete archive is streamed and verified before only its owned live profile"
" scratch is retired. Original live artifact paths then remain historical "
"locators; the result index supplies the archive and member-relative "
"navigation used for current verification."
msgstr ""
"The same source, clean Source SDK, authored configuration, recursive "
"dependency pins, compiler/toolchain and OCI identities bind the executed "
"commands and actual ELF/BIN/map/resource bytes. Each candidate passes the "
"owned verifier and an actual fixed-checker `dev candidate` plan. Each "
"complete archive is streamed and verified before only its owned live profile"
" scratch is retired. Original live artifact paths then remain historical "
"locators; the result index supplies the archive and member-relative "
"navigation used for current verification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:132
msgid ""
"Two earlier matrices remain failed with zero qualified profiles: the first "
"exhausted storage during reproduction, and the second passed two fresh "
"builds but could not seal after temporary SDK reference files had been "
"cleaned up. Independent review restored 102 exact original references from "
"precaptured identities and verified source and original SDK proof records "
"unchanged. The failed scratch was fully archived before retirement. These "
"are storage operations; they do not add source behavior, a new SDK test "
"execution or platform support. The new matrix uses the separate `cc6a065c00`"
" namespace and qualifies all eight profiles from its own fresh builds and "
"actual executed candidate plans."
msgstr ""
"Two earlier matrices remain failed with zero qualified profiles: the first "
"exhausted storage during reproduction, and the second passed two fresh "
"builds but could not seal after temporary SDK reference files had been "
"cleaned up. Independent review restored 102 exact original references from "
"precaptured identities and verified source and original SDK proof records "
"unchanged. The failed scratch was fully archived before retirement. These "
"are storage operations; they do not add source behavior, a new SDK test "
"execution or platform support. The new matrix uses the separate `cc6a065c00`"
" namespace and qualifies all eight profiles from its own fresh builds and "
"actual executed candidate plans."

