#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:162
msgid ""
"The final Linux x86_64 CP312 lock contains 15 hash-locked wheels. A fresh "
"CP312 virtual environment executes a no-index, hash-required installation. "
"Actual `pre-commit install --install-hooks` primes the Python hook with "
"PEP517 build isolation enabled, and the isolated interpreter executes the "
"complete tool domains. Setuptools is included for local PEP517 backend "
"preparation; the hook has its exact PyYAML, pre-commit and clang-format "
"runtime closure. Vendored nested wheel metadata remains covered by the "
"whole-wheel digest, while top-level canonical distribution identity and "
"duplicate metadata are checked strictly."
msgstr ""
"The final Linux x86_64 CP312 lock contains 15 hash-locked wheels. A fresh "
"CP312 virtual environment executes a no-index, hash-required installation. "
"Actual `pre-commit install --install-hooks` primes the Python hook with "
"PEP517 build isolation enabled, and the isolated interpreter executes the "
"complete tool domains. Setuptools is included for local PEP517 backend "
"preparation; the hook has its exact PyYAML, pre-commit and clang-format "
"runtime closure. Vendored nested wheel metadata remains covered by the "
"whole-wheel digest, while top-level canonical distribution identity and "
"duplicate metadata are checked strictly."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/build-system-verification.md:171
msgid ""
"CP311 wheel bytes are verified against the declared lock. CP311 installation"
" is `not_executed`. The original 14-wheel runtime bundles remain historical "
"artifacts and are not relabelled as the new hook closure. Linux is the "
"executed host scope; Windows/macOS integration and non-Linux descendant "
"cancellation remain untested."
msgstr ""
"CP311 wheel bytes are verified against the declared lock. CP311 installation"
" is `not_executed`. The original 14-wheel runtime bundles remain historical "
"artifacts and are not relabelled as the new hook closure. Linux is the "
"executed host scope; Windows/macOS integration and non-Linux descendant "
"cancellation remain untested."

